{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u258cStory</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;DUNGEON&quot;\u2014a realm brimming with dreams, hope, and romance, the ultimate playground for daring adventurers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The martial artist in training, &quot;Maika&quot;, is challenging this dungeon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dungeon she braves holds treasures left by legendary martial artists...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Maika ventures through the dungeon, a floor with an eerie, unfamiliar atmosphere suddenly emerges...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is Maika's tale of facing a deadly trap in the dungeon...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u258cHow to Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>\u25b2 Catch every anomaly! </u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857950/extras/9c65ca4ba3b1aa88a1762580125224da.avif?t=1769068846\" width=600 height=336 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Guidelines\u3011</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1.At 0, no changes occur.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2.Beyond 0, stay sharp\u2014don't miss a single anomaly. (Hold your nerve until the very end.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3.If you detect an anomaly, turn back immediately.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4.If everything seems normal, press forward without hesitation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5.After reaching 7 with no anomalies spotted, you're free to break out of the trap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>\u25b2 Keep missing anomalies, and...</u></strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3857950/extras/f536a66a6ab908c59ed42e5a10256891.avif?t=1769068846\" width=600 height=334 /></spa